]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7403bf1e-766e-11f1-8fdb-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26183837000277.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/7403bf1e-766e-11f1-8fdb-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26183837000277.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">8b61fe3a-7701-11f1-a0fc-09467176ad5b</guid><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 18:00:15 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Annie Gasnier</dc:creator></item></channel></rss>
